#, fuzzy
msgid "As an alternative to full Dev Services, you can enable a simplified Dev Resources mode. In this mode, containers are started lazily at runtime via a MicroProfile `ConfigSource` instead of during the build phase. This means there is no shared container discovery, no compose support, no Dev UI card and no OpenTelemetry override properties injected."
